  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the sliced red onion and cook for 2 minutes or until softened.",
    "Add the oyster mushrooms and cook for 4 minutes or until slightly browned, stirring occasionally.",
    "Stir in the garlic powder, dried oregano, salt, and pepper.",
    "Add the sliced cucumber and cook for an additional 2 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together the lemon juice and white vinegar.",
    "Pour the dressing over the mushrooms and cucumber mixture, and toss to combine.",
    "Top with crumbled feta cheese, chopped parsley, and pitted kalamata olives.",
    "Serve immediately, garnished with additional parsley if desired."
